1
00:00:52,240 --> 00:00:52,800
Brother.

2
00:00:58,360 --> 00:01:00,280
All the possible murder weapons on the market,

3
00:01:00,280 --> 00:01:01,680
we've brought them all back.

4
00:01:01,680 --> 00:01:02,800
None of them match.

5
00:01:03,600 --> 00:01:05,400
I think Liu Ming's fatal wound

6
00:01:05,400 --> 00:01:07,530
looks like it was caused by this thing.

7
00:01:08,039 --> 00:01:09,570
You watch too many TV shows.

8
00:01:09,800 --> 00:01:11,880
As for the common crossbow arrows on the market,

9
00:01:11,880 --> 00:01:13,280
we've compared them all.

10
00:01:13,720 --> 00:01:15,800
The wound is narrow and small,

11
00:01:15,800 --> 00:01:17,330
different from this arrow.

12
00:01:19,640 --> 00:01:21,120
Still obsessing over the murder weapon?

13
00:01:21,120 --> 00:01:23,250
We still have to start with the people.

14
00:01:23,840 --> 00:01:24,680
Officer Liu,

15
00:01:25,039 --> 00:01:26,039
you've been working hard lately.

16
00:01:26,039 --> 00:01:27,300
Go back and rest first.

17
00:01:27,960 --> 00:01:29,760
Okay. If you need me for anything,

18
00:01:29,760 --> 00:01:31,080
come to my office anytime.

19
00:01:31,080 --> 00:01:31,680
Okay.

20
00:01:35,560 --> 00:01:37,800
Have you checked Wang Hong and Li Xuefei?

21
00:01:37,800 --> 00:01:38,479
Yes.

22
00:01:39,640 --> 00:01:42,120
Wang Hong is quite famous in Jiangcheng,

23
00:01:42,440 --> 00:01:43,640
but it's a bit weird.

24
00:01:43,640 --> 00:01:45,680
I couldn't find any information about his family.

25
00:01:45,680 --> 00:01:46,680
What about Li Xuefei?

26
00:01:46,680 --> 00:01:48,120
Her father is Li Zhijun,

27
00:01:48,120 --> 00:01:49,880
who owns a timber mill in Xinchun.

28
00:01:49,880 --> 00:01:52,120
She works in her own family's factory.

29
00:01:52,400 --> 00:01:54,200
So far, there's no problem.

30
00:01:55,600 --> 00:01:58,320
Are these two still staying at the Lincheng Hotel?

31
00:01:58,320 --> 00:02:00,880
Yes, they moved from the third floor to the second.

32
00:02:00,880 --> 00:02:02,200
These two are quite weird.

33
00:02:02,200 --> 00:02:03,330
Aren't they afraid?

34
00:02:06,080 --> 00:02:06,760
Brother,

35
00:02:08,400 --> 00:02:10,520
do you think Zhou Guangfu's case

36
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:12,730
and Liu Ming's case at the hotel

37
00:02:12,920 --> 00:02:15,120
could have been done by the same person?

38
00:02:16,440 --> 00:02:18,040
Look at Liu Ming's case.

39
00:02:18,320 --> 00:02:19,600
The room is very clean,

40
00:02:20,200 --> 00:02:21,720
as if someone came to do a job

41
00:02:21,720 --> 00:02:22,920
and left right after.

42
00:02:23,360 --> 00:02:25,220
Compared to Zhou Guangfu's room,

43
00:02:25,680 --> 00:02:27,280
it's completely different.

44
00:02:28,600 --> 00:02:30,600
These two cases are so close in time,

45
00:02:31,640 --> 00:02:33,560
and both people died in a hotel.

46
00:02:33,560 --> 00:02:35,820
I think it's very likely the same person.

47
00:02:36,480 --> 00:02:37,810
It's not the same thing.

48
00:02:38,640 --> 00:02:40,480
Have you checked people with criminal records?

49
00:02:40,480 --> 00:02:41,520
Pretty much.

50
00:02:42,160 --> 00:02:43,400
They're either still in jail

51
00:02:43,400 --> 00:02:44,600
or out of town.

52
00:02:44,760 --> 00:02:45,440
As for the others,

53
00:02:45,440 --> 00:02:47,770
the other guys in the bureau know them too.

54
00:02:48,600 --> 00:02:49,600
Go find someone

55
00:02:50,160 --> 00:02:51,560
a few years older than me,

56
00:02:51,920 --> 00:02:53,440
who grew up near the forestry center.

57
00:02:53,440 --> 00:02:54,440
His name is Gecko.

58
00:02:56,280 --> 00:02:57,280
So you know him?

59
00:02:58,040 --> 00:02:59,570
I knew him when we were kids,

60
00:02:59,640 --> 00:03:01,240
but we lost touch after that.

61
00:03:01,800 --> 00:03:03,840
This kid could climb boiler rooms and trees.

62
00:03:03,840 --> 00:03:05,900
There was nowhere he couldn't climb.

63
00:03:06,680 --> 00:03:07,740
Childhood friend.

64
00:03:12,560 --> 00:03:13,160
Who is it?

65
00:03:19,160 --> 00:03:20,520
Put it on speaker.

66
00:03:21,960 --> 00:03:22,960
Tomorrow at noon,

67
00:03:23,440 --> 00:03:26,400
Teng Xiaohu invited Wang Hong, an out-of-town timber boss,

68
00:03:26,400 --> 00:03:28,860
to negotiate at the Beishan Hunting Ground.

69
00:04:13,280 --> 00:04:15,280
Why do you have to go see Teng Xiaohu?

70
00:04:15,720 --> 00:04:16,839
That guy is a lunatic.

71
00:04:16,839 --> 00:04:18,120
He's capable of anything.

72
00:04:18,120 --> 00:04:19,250
It's too dangerous.

73
00:04:19,480 --> 00:04:21,000
Didn't I ask you to call

74
00:04:21,000 --> 00:04:22,280
Ma from the criminal investigation team?

75
00:04:22,280 --> 00:04:24,200
He'll probably take Cao Jin with him.

76
00:04:24,200 --> 00:04:26,530
What if Cao Jin and the others can't get in?

77
00:04:27,520 --> 00:04:29,960
Beishan Hunting Ground is Teng Xiaohu's territory.

78
00:04:29,960 --> 00:04:31,600
Even if they can't get in, I have a plan.

79
00:04:31,600 --> 00:04:32,480
Don't worry.

80
00:04:36,200 --> 00:04:38,080
Are you sure you don't need me to come along?

81
00:04:38,080 --> 00:04:38,720
No.

82
00:04:39,040 --> 00:04:39,760
Just keep a close eye on

83
00:04:39,760 --> 00:04:41,490
Old Hongsong and those bosses.

84
00:04:43,040 --> 00:04:43,640
Okay.

85
00:04:53,680 --> 00:04:54,810
I was playing a game.

86
00:04:55,000 --> 00:04:56,800
Why did you turn off my computer?

87
00:04:58,120 --> 00:04:59,120
I'm sorry.

88
00:04:59,120 --> 00:05:00,480
I didn't mean to.

89
00:05:00,480 --> 00:05:01,840
I just didn't see it.

90
00:05:01,840 --> 00:05:02,480
You didn't mean to?

91
00:05:02,480 --> 00:05:03,560
Then you did it on purpose,

92
00:05:03,560 --> 00:05:04,040
right?

93
00:05:04,920 --> 00:05:06,480
There are so many empty seats over there.

94
00:05:06,480 --> 00:05:07,600
Why do you have to sit here

95
00:05:07,600 --> 00:05:08,720
and sit right next to me?

96
00:05:08,720 --> 00:05:10,080
Watch your mouth.

97
00:05:10,080 --> 00:05:11,000
Do you think you're so popular

98
00:05:11,000 --> 00:05:12,400
that I have to sit next to you?

99
00:05:12,400 --> 00:05:13,600
I didn't do it on purpose,

100
00:05:13,600 --> 00:05:15,160
and I apologized to you.

101
00:05:15,800 --> 00:05:16,530
You're sick.

102
00:05:17,080 --> 00:05:17,720
No.

103
00:05:18,480 --> 00:05:19,810
Does your apology help?

104
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:20,600
You turned off my computer,

105
00:05:20,600 --> 00:05:21,840
and you call me sick?

106
00:05:22,680 --> 00:05:23,840
I'm sorry, kid.

107
00:05:23,840 --> 00:05:25,240
It's our fault. Let's go.

108
00:05:25,920 --> 00:05:26,560
Go?

109
00:05:26,560 --> 00:05:27,320
My game...

110
00:05:27,320 --> 00:05:28,520
You...

111
00:05:28,520 --> 00:05:29,040
Kid?

112
00:05:29,040 --> 00:05:29,960
Who are you calling a kid?

113
00:05:29,960 --> 00:05:31,490
Your whole family are kids!

114
00:05:45,560 --> 00:05:48,760
Sister, get in my big bridal sedan chair.

115
00:06:06,840 --> 00:06:07,520
When you eat instant noodles,

116
00:06:07,520 --> 00:06:09,320
can you stop smacking your lips?

117
00:06:09,920 --> 00:06:11,120
Why are you smacking?

118
00:06:11,800 --> 00:06:12,600
Boss!

119
00:06:13,120 --> 00:06:14,650
Add another sausage for me.

120
00:06:37,000 --> 00:06:37,760
Mr. Wang,

121
00:06:38,120 --> 00:06:39,960
about stopping the car at the train station,

122
00:06:39,960 --> 00:06:41,560
it really wasn't on purpose.

123
00:06:41,800 --> 00:06:43,520
Please don't take it to heart.

124
00:06:44,400 --> 00:06:45,200
It's fine.

125
00:06:45,440 --> 00:06:46,770
It wasn't my car anyway.

126
00:06:48,680 --> 00:06:49,810
By the way, Mr. Teng,

127
00:06:50,960 --> 00:06:52,560
your hunting ground,

128
00:06:52,840 --> 00:06:54,840
it doesn't have wild boars, does it?

129
00:06:56,120 --> 00:06:59,680
Wild boars are only in the mountains.

130
00:07:00,160 --> 00:07:03,080
Our hunting ground definitely doesn't have any.

131
00:07:03,080 --> 00:07:03,680
No.

132
00:07:04,720 --> 00:07:06,180
I just wanted to remind you

133
00:07:06,720 --> 00:07:09,600
to take care of your body if you hunt often.

134
00:07:10,000 --> 00:07:13,040
After all, getting hit by a wild boar really hurts.

135
00:07:13,440 --> 00:07:14,840
You're joking, Mr. Wang.

136
00:07:15,640 --> 00:07:17,200
Mr. Teng is in such good shape.

137
00:07:17,200 --> 00:07:18,760
Getting hit wouldn't do anything to him,

138
00:07:18,760 --> 00:07:19,400
right?

139
00:07:25,160 --> 00:07:25,800
Brother.

140
00:07:26,160 --> 00:07:27,160
Are we going up?

141
00:07:27,640 --> 00:07:29,360
That guy wouldn't trick us, would he?

142
00:07:29,360 --> 00:07:31,680
Besides, can we even go into this private forest?

143
00:07:31,680 --> 00:07:33,280
What private forest?

144
00:07:33,680 --> 00:07:35,440
They just leased a piece of forest.

145
00:07:35,440 --> 00:07:37,840
Haven't you been saying you're tired lately?

146
00:07:37,840 --> 00:07:39,440
I'll take you up for a stroll.

147
00:07:42,920 --> 00:07:43,880
Such a good deal?

148
00:07:44,040 --> 00:07:45,440
Of course.

149
00:07:46,320 --> 00:07:48,440
This is all our own land.

150
00:07:48,640 --> 00:07:50,100
Look around as you please.

151
00:07:50,320 --> 00:07:51,880
This is all a private area.

152
00:07:51,880 --> 00:07:53,120
It's not open to the public.

153
00:07:53,120 --> 00:07:55,320
What do you usually hunt here?

154
00:07:56,159 --> 00:07:57,000
Don't rush.

155
00:07:57,320 --> 00:07:58,080
Look ahead.

156
00:08:00,400 --> 00:08:01,000
Greet him.

157
00:08:01,120 --> 00:08:02,280
Hello, Mr. Hu.

158
00:08:03,920 --> 00:08:05,520
Mr. Wang, you might not know.

159
00:08:05,520 --> 00:08:07,520
Hunting wild animals is not allowed in this forest,

160
00:08:07,520 --> 00:08:09,920
so we can only hunt some chickens, ducks,

161
00:08:09,920 --> 00:08:11,320
and rabbits.

162
00:08:11,760 --> 00:08:12,640
Right, Mr. Hu?

163
00:08:13,840 --> 00:08:15,960
There's nothing we can do now.

164
00:08:16,080 --> 00:08:18,010
We used to be able to hunt anything.

165
00:08:18,360 --> 00:08:19,000
Mr. Wang,

166
00:08:19,760 --> 00:08:21,020
take a couple of shots.

167
00:08:21,320 --> 00:08:22,680
What's the fun in that?

168
00:08:23,040 --> 00:08:24,680
My hand injury hasn't healed yet.

169
00:08:24,680 --> 00:08:25,600
Today,

170
00:08:25,920 --> 00:08:28,320
I mainly want to see Mr. Hu's marksmanship.

171
00:08:47,720 --> 00:08:49,250
Good marksmanship, Mr. Hu.

172
00:08:49,520 --> 00:08:49,960
Really.

173
00:08:49,960 --> 00:08:51,400
The rabbit almost died.

174
00:08:51,760 --> 00:08:52,680
I think,

175
00:08:53,200 --> 00:08:54,930
this rabbit is suffering a lot.

176
00:08:55,600 --> 00:08:56,200
Mr. Hu,

177
00:08:56,880 --> 00:08:58,920
you brought us all the way here.

178
00:08:59,200 --> 00:09:00,080
Just speak your mind.

179
00:09:00,080 --> 00:09:01,840
Mr. Wang, you're straightforward.

180
00:09:01,840 --> 00:09:03,700
Then I won't beat around the bush.

181
00:09:04,320 --> 00:09:06,360
I heard that you came to Xinchun this time

182
00:09:06,360 --> 00:09:08,090
to get a batch of timber, right?

183
00:09:08,680 --> 00:09:10,360
I don't know what kind you want.

184
00:09:10,360 --> 00:09:11,960
Our Menghu Processing Plant

185
00:09:12,160 --> 00:09:13,160
has nothing else,

186
00:09:13,240 --> 00:09:14,480
but we have a lot of connections

187
00:09:14,480 --> 00:09:15,440
and ways.

188
00:09:15,720 --> 00:09:17,240
If it's about this matter,

189
00:09:17,720 --> 00:09:18,580
then forget it.

190
00:09:19,520 --> 00:09:21,380
We are not the same kind of people.

191
00:09:21,480 --> 00:09:22,610
We can't cooperate.

192
00:09:31,120 --> 00:09:33,450
What do you mean we're not on the same path?

193
00:09:33,560 --> 00:09:35,690
Haven't we come all this way together?

194
00:09:35,920 --> 00:09:36,850
Right, Mr. Wang?

195
00:09:37,880 --> 00:09:38,410
Mr. Wang,

196
00:09:38,640 --> 00:09:40,520
if you don't make yourself clear,

197
00:09:40,760 --> 00:09:43,020
how do you know we're not on the same path?

198
00:09:44,040 --> 00:09:45,500
What I want is old red pine.

199
00:09:45,960 --> 00:09:48,360
The quantity is two thousand cubic meters.

200
00:09:48,520 --> 00:09:50,050
Two thousand cubic meters?

201
00:09:51,680 --> 00:09:53,680
Then you've definitely found the right person.

202
00:09:53,680 --> 00:09:56,360
You can't go wrong leaving this to me, Teng Xiaohu.

203
00:09:56,360 --> 00:09:57,220
Leave it to you?

204
00:09:58,000 --> 00:09:58,760
Do you really think you're worthy of discussing

205
00:09:58,760 --> 00:10:01,000
the 2,000-meter old red pine order with me?

206
00:10:01,000 --> 00:10:02,920
How dare you make such a guarantee?

207
00:10:02,920 --> 00:10:03,800
Teng Xiaohu.

208
00:10:04,000 --> 00:10:05,080
Your factory's capital chain

209
00:10:05,080 --> 00:10:06,940
has been broken for three months.

210
00:10:07,160 --> 00:10:08,600
You can't even pay your workers' wages.

211
00:10:08,600 --> 00:10:11,440
The goods piled up in your warehouse are almost getting moldy.

212
00:10:11,440 --> 00:10:12,560
Do you really think I don't know why

213
00:10:12,560 --> 00:10:14,560
you're so desperate for this order?

214
00:10:15,160 --> 00:10:16,200
But I'm sorry.

215
00:10:16,560 --> 00:10:17,640
I don't want to work with

216
00:10:17,640 --> 00:10:19,440
a half-dead factory like yours.

217
00:10:19,440 --> 00:10:20,560
There are so many factories

218
00:10:20,560 --> 00:10:21,820
and bosses in Xinchun.

219
00:10:21,960 --> 00:10:22,760
Any random one I pick

220
00:10:22,760 --> 00:10:24,290
would be better than yours.

221
00:10:24,840 --> 00:10:25,520
Master Hu.

222
00:10:26,760 --> 00:10:27,760
You'd better just

223
00:10:28,000 --> 00:10:29,730
stick to playing with rabbits.

224
00:10:30,360 --> 00:10:31,120
Wang Hong.

225
00:10:31,760 --> 00:10:34,160
You investigated me secretly, didn't you?

226
00:10:34,560 --> 00:10:36,760
Does it even require an investigation?

227
00:10:37,600 --> 00:10:39,520
Xinchun is only so big.

228
00:10:40,360 --> 00:10:41,420
Do you really think

229
00:10:41,560 --> 00:10:44,120
riding on your father's fading reputation

230
00:10:44,440 --> 00:10:46,440
and shouting at the top of your lungs

231
00:10:46,440 --> 00:10:47,700
will get you business?

232
00:10:48,560 --> 00:10:50,420
Weren't you also trying your best

233
00:10:50,520 --> 00:10:51,580
to investigate me?

234
00:10:51,880 --> 00:10:53,610
It's just returning the favor.

235
00:10:53,920 --> 00:10:56,320
You should brag less.

236
00:10:56,640 --> 00:10:57,440
From now on,

237
00:10:57,680 --> 00:10:59,560
just pack up and wait for bankruptcy.

238
00:10:59,560 --> 00:11:02,160
And stop doing things like playing with wild boars.

239
00:11:02,160 --> 00:11:04,220
I won't hold it against you this time.

240
00:11:04,480 --> 00:11:05,810
You have a small family,

241
00:11:05,960 --> 00:11:07,640
so no one taught you manners.

242
00:11:07,640 --> 00:11:08,600
I understand.

243
00:11:09,040 --> 00:11:10,700
But there won't be a next time.

244
00:11:11,000 --> 00:11:11,800
Wang Hong.

245
00:11:13,240 --> 00:11:15,760
I've been too nice to you, haven't I?

246
00:11:17,560 --> 00:11:18,120
Let's go.

247
00:11:22,120 --> 00:11:23,400
Is my territory a place

248
00:11:23,840 --> 00:11:26,640
you can just come and go as you please?

249
00:11:33,480 --> 00:11:34,210
Teng Xiaohu.

250
00:11:35,320 --> 00:11:37,520
We can let the wild boar incident slide.

251
00:11:37,760 --> 00:11:39,760
But let me give you a piece of advice.

252
00:11:40,000 --> 00:11:41,400
Leave yourself a way out.

253
00:11:41,640 --> 00:11:42,900
Otherwise, in the end,

254
00:11:43,360 --> 00:11:45,020
no one will be able to save you.

255
00:11:45,400 --> 00:11:46,160
Li Xuefei,

256
00:11:46,920 --> 00:11:48,720
you're with him now, aren't you?

257
00:11:49,080 --> 00:11:50,720
For your father's sake,

258
00:11:51,440 --> 00:11:52,880
I won't touch you today.

259
00:11:53,600 --> 00:11:54,360
Get out.

260
00:11:56,320 --> 00:11:57,200
Wang,

261
00:11:57,880 --> 00:11:59,080
you have to stay here.

262
00:11:59,880 --> 00:12:00,560
Kneel down,

263
00:12:01,200 --> 00:12:02,520
and apologize to me.

264
00:12:03,920 --> 00:12:05,240
I'll count to three.

265
00:12:12,720 --> 00:12:13,600
Teng Xiaohu,

266
00:12:14,520 --> 00:12:16,250
since things have come to this,

267
00:12:16,520 --> 00:12:17,850
I'll tell you the truth.

268
00:12:17,880 --> 00:12:19,920
Someone with nothing to lose fears no one.

269
00:12:19,920 --> 00:12:22,520
As long as I, Li Xuefei, leave here alive today,

270
00:12:22,560 --> 00:12:23,480
I promise,

271
00:12:23,720 --> 00:12:27,840
your family's factory will definitely be shut down for inspection tomorrow.

272
00:12:27,840 --> 00:12:28,840
Do you believe me?

273
00:12:36,120 --> 00:12:36,920
Beat him up!

274
00:12:36,920 --> 00:12:37,800
Officer Cao.

275
00:12:40,480 --> 00:12:42,440
Where are they?

276
00:12:45,480 --> 00:12:47,140
Isn't that Teng Xiaohu's car?

277
00:12:48,480 --> 00:12:49,720
Looks like it.

278
00:12:50,760 --> 00:12:52,160
Then they must be nearby.

279
00:12:54,080 --> 00:12:55,680
Go after them.

280
00:12:55,680 --> 00:12:56,640
Give me the gun.

281
00:12:58,200 --> 00:12:58,800
This way.

282
00:13:07,760 --> 00:13:08,800
Stop right there!

283
00:13:09,000 --> 00:13:09,800
Police!

284
00:13:10,200 --> 00:13:11,080
Let's go, Ma.

285
00:13:12,200 --> 00:13:12,960
Stop!

286
00:13:16,720 --> 00:13:17,320
Mr. Lin.

287
00:13:18,520 --> 00:13:19,920
Something big happened.

288
00:13:20,400 --> 00:13:22,260
Teng Xiaohu and his men used guns.

289
00:13:22,520 --> 00:13:24,840
I saw Wang Hong and Li Xuefei run away together.

290
00:13:24,840 --> 00:13:27,040
That cop named Cao is also chasing them.

291
00:13:27,120 --> 00:13:28,080
Listen to me.

292
00:13:28,960 --> 00:13:31,160
Capture all the footage clearly,

293
00:13:31,600 --> 00:13:35,200
especially Teng Xiaohu holding and firing the gun.

294
00:13:35,880 --> 00:13:37,240
Record everything.

295
00:13:37,240 --> 00:13:38,700
Don't miss a single thing.

296
00:13:38,960 --> 00:13:40,200
I hear you, I hear you.

297
00:13:41,200 --> 00:13:41,920
Also,

298
00:13:43,040 --> 00:13:44,200
if necessary,

299
00:13:44,800 --> 00:13:45,920
protect Wang Hong.

300
00:13:49,280 --> 00:13:50,140
Did you hear me?

301
00:13:50,640 --> 00:13:51,400
Okay.

302
00:13:51,720 --> 00:13:52,720
Mr. Lin, I'm hanging up now.

303
00:13:52,720 --> 00:13:53,580
I'm hanging up.

304
00:13:53,680 --> 00:13:54,400
Stay safe.

305
00:13:59,400 --> 00:13:59,960
No.

306
00:14:01,120 --> 00:14:02,320
We're too big a target.

307
00:14:02,320 --> 00:14:03,180
Let's split up.

308
00:14:03,720 --> 00:14:04,160
You go that way.

309
00:14:04,160 --> 00:14:04,680
Okay.

310
00:14:14,320 --> 00:14:15,160
You three,

311
00:14:15,640 --> 00:14:16,560
go after that woman.

312
00:14:16,560 --> 00:14:17,280
Okay, boss.

313
00:14:17,280 --> 00:14:18,410
You two come with me.

314
00:14:20,480 --> 00:14:22,320
Stop! Don't run!

315
00:14:24,040 --> 00:14:25,600
Stop! Don't run!
